# Files clang-format must not reformat.
# One repo-relative glob per line (matched relative to this file's directory).

# cfg.cpp embeds raw Emscripten/JavaScript inside EM_ASM(...) macros, guarded
# with // clang-format off/on. clang-format has a reproducible bug where
# reformatting this file (even with the guards in place) mis-indents
# everything after the guarded block by re-parsing the JS as malformed C++
# brace/paren nesting. Keep this file hand-formatted instead.
src/cfg/cfg.cpp

# fs_osx.mm is Objective-C++; this project's .clang-format has no ObjC
# language mode, so clang-format refuses to reformat it (and is not
# idempotent when forced). Keep it hand-formatted instead.
src/base/fs_osx.mm

# http_request_wasm.cpp embeds raw JavaScript inside a MAIN_THREAD_EM_ASM(...)
# macro (arrow functions, object literals). clang-format corrupts `=>` into
# `= >` when reformatting this file, same class of bug as cfg.cpp above.
# Keep it hand-formatted instead.
src/net/http_request_wasm.cpp
